The built extension (dist/) bundles third-party software. The main components are:

- markdown-it (MIT)
- highlight.js (BSD-3-Clause)
- DOMPurify (used under Apache-2.0)
- Mermaid (MIT) and its dependencies

Mermaid includes elkjs, which is licensed under the Eclipse Public License 2.0. It is
distributed here unmodified, as a separate file (dist/chunks/elk-*.js). Its source code is
available at https://github.com/kieler/elkjs.

The full license text of every bundled package is written to THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt
by the build.
